      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berger%2C_Missouri",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Berger once hosted a railroad station, earning the nickname Berger Station during the height of rail travel.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
